1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,331
Hi friends!

2
00:00:01,331 --> 00:00:03,465
Let's learn big and small!

3
00:00:04,015 --> 00:00:05,173
I am small.

4
00:00:05,173 --> 00:00:06,495
Mimzi is big!

5
00:00:07,845 --> 00:00:09,893
This ball is big.

6
00:00:10,293 --> 00:00:12,317
This ball is small.

7
00:00:12,817 --> 00:00:15,175
Big ball, small ball!

8
00:00:16,525 --> 00:00:18,478
Which teddy is big?

9
00:00:20,478 --> 00:00:21,487
This one!

10
00:00:21,487 --> 00:00:22,917
The big teddy!

11
00:00:23,467 --> 00:00:25,947
And this is the small teddy.

12
00:00:27,297 --> 00:00:29,368
This apple is big.

13
00:00:29,768 --> 00:00:31,840
This apple is small.

14
00:00:32,340 --> 00:00:34,840
Big apple, small apple!

15
00:00:36,190 --> 00:00:38,071
Which car is big?

16
00:00:40,071 --> 00:00:41,128
This one!

17
00:00:41,128 --> 00:00:42,450
The big car!

18
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:45,339
And this is the small car.

19
00:00:46,689 --> 00:00:48,760
This balloon is big.

20
00:00:49,160 --> 00:00:51,208
This balloon is small.

21
00:00:51,708 --> 00:00:54,409
Big balloon, small balloon!

22
00:00:55,759 --> 00:00:57,711
Which star is big?

23
00:00:59,711 --> 00:01:00,740
This one!

24
00:01:00,740 --> 00:01:02,111
The big star!

25
00:01:02,661 --> 00:01:05,100
And this is the small star.

26
00:01:06,450 --> 00:01:08,272
An elephant is big.

27
00:01:08,272 --> 00:01:10,093
A ladybug is small.

28
00:01:10,593 --> 00:01:13,537
Big elephant, tiny ladybug!

29
00:01:14,087 --> 00:01:15,452
Stomp, stomp!

30
00:01:15,452 --> 00:01:16,647
Buzz, buzz!

31
00:01:17,997 --> 00:01:19,949
Make yourself big!

32
00:01:21,349 --> 00:01:22,635
Big, big, big!

33
00:01:22,635 --> 00:01:24,071
Stretch up high!

34
00:01:24,671 --> 00:01:26,814
Now make yourself small!

35
00:01:28,214 --> 00:01:29,819
Small, small, small!

36
00:01:29,819 --> 00:01:30,936
Curl up tiny!

37
00:01:32,336 --> 00:01:34,574
Great job, little learner!

38
00:01:35,124 --> 00:01:37,012
Share Mimzi with a friend,

39
00:01:37,012 --> 00:01:39,552
and subscribe for more learning fun!

40
00:01:40,102 --> 00:01:41,116
Next time,

41
00:01:41,116 --> 00:01:43,066
let's learn opposites.

42
00:01:43,316 --> 00:01:44,687
Bye bye!
